            "review_text": "Phi N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam441 contributions\n0\nSky Lounge......Secret\nOct 2018 • Friends\nI didn't realize there was a city view at this Restaurants. I thought it was mainly a beer club, but was surprised to see it serving wind and a big steak. This makes this place a hidden charm, off the beating path for a great view of city, kicking back with some wine and big steaks.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 5, 2018",
