            "review_title": "Review at Vuvuzela",
            "review_text": "Hieu Dan\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n1\nMy first-time-ever to enjoy the vibe of this so-called beer club.\nMay 2018 • Friends\nTo be honest, I'm not wholly keen on ambiance of these hooters. I made up my mind to get here cuz it was my friends's birthday and I didnt want to rain on their parades then we all made it to here after having had a few drinks beforehand. \n\nFirst the inside atmosphere was well-decorated with green spaces. The views were breathtaking on rooftop overlooking the skyline of the city.\nThen the staff brought out a jug of Budweiser which was pretty cold. The music was amazing with loads of over-excited local people shouting and dancing which truly struck me at first. On the flip side, food was half decent somehow that wouldnt make all of us satisfied. \nOverall, We had a blast in it so I wouldnt mind the food whatsoever. This so-called beer club would be a nice try for those who wish to laugh, dance and drink not a place for relaxing or meditating.\nRead more\nWritten May 17, 2018",
