            "review_text": "Occam_Smith\n83 contributions\n0\nBeer poured out the drip trays!\nFeb 2017 • Friends\nThis review is in relation to the Vuvuzela at Vivo City, District 7. \n\nWent here mid afternoon a week ago and ordered two glasses of Paulaner. I watched in absolute awe as the bar steward filled up the pints with the contents of the drip tray. When I asked what he was doing he looked confused and when I cancelled the order he looked most put out and proceeded to put cling film over the glasses and pop them in the fridge for the next lucky customer.\n\nTruly astounding and a good way to make someone very ill!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 23, 2017",
