            "review_text": "jinxedta\nsan bernardino7 contributions\n0\nway below par\nDec 2016 • Friends\nI you like loud ear aching music being played, ok food and sub par service this place is for you. \n\nIt's a place trying to be trendy, having no identity. Is it a bar, is it a club, is it a restaurant? it's kinda all 3 rolled into one, and executed horribly.\n\nyou have to yell at the top of your lungs just to get some help. \n\nfood was mediocre at best, mostly pre-maid re-fried items. \nThey kinda force you to binge drink while there. I watched 2 guys throw up while in the bathroom. \n\nto sum it up this will be my first and last visit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 22, 2017",
